sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant MW as Middleware
    participant R as Route
    participant D as Dependencies
    participant S as Service
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    UI->>MW: Request with Bearer token and workspace header
    MW->>MW: Attach request ID, apply CORS
    MW->>R: Forward
    R->>D: Verify token, check workspace membership
    D->>DB: Membership lookup
    D-->>R: Authorized workspace ID
    R->>R: Validate payload and query parameters
    R->>S: Invoke use case
    S->>Repo: Workspace-scoped operation
    Repo->>DB: Query or transaction
    DB-->>Repo: Rows or constraint error
    Repo-->>S: Result
    S-->>R: Resource and audit event ID
    R-->>UI: Typed response or error envelope
